      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The relationship between the antilipolytic action of glucose and the parameters characterizing the weight and state of the adipose tissue was studied in 60 patients with acute myocardial infarction. The amount of fat in the body was assessed, and the morphological structure of the adipose tissue determined. A sharp decrease in the antilipolytic effect of the peroral administration of glucose was observed in patients with a complicated course of the disease and adiposity of hyperplastic nature."},
